{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and take it. Check object properties and do specific task, then move to next area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectReached    /> <Condition ID = IsTaskNeeded    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextArea    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    />\"",
